WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:05.920
My second son... oh, my second son. You have truly grown up—not a single word of truth left for your Emperor.

00:06.600 --> 00:11.720
How many severed heads rolled last night? I have not yet grown blind and deaf!

00:15.920 --> 00:17.500
Go and see your mother.

00:18.320 --> 00:21.500
Father—
You are no longer a boy. It is time you left for your fief.

00:27.500 --> 00:41.500
Three days later, the Emperor issued an imperial edict assigning the northern frontier region of Dingzhou as the Prince of Jin's fief, ordering you to take up your post on an auspicious day.
